SUMMARY:✓ Tuesday 5k · easy · 5 km
DESCRIPTION:Strava: 5 km at 5:58/km\, avg HR 134\n\n• 5:00–5:15/km. Don
 't race it this week.\n\nWhy: Keeps the legs moving. Your fitness is alrea
 dy built.\n\nFuel: None needed. Eat a normal carb-based meal afterwards.\n
 \nHeart rate guide (estimated from your recent runs\, may be off):\n• 5:
 00–5:15/km: easy\, HR 125–150. Over 150 means slow down\n\nRUN GUIDE\n
 \nHow it should feel: Easy. You'll feel restless with the taper. That's no
 rmal. Don't race it.\n\nHow to run it:\n• 5:00–5:15/km the whole way\n
 • Let the racers go\n\nElevation: Flat. Under 20 m of climbing\, like th
 e Good George course (+5 m) or your usual morning loop.\n\nBack off if:\n
 • If you find yourself under 5:00\, back off\n\nAfterwards: Normal dinne
 r. Early night.\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
