DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261030
SUMMARY:✓ Morning pace check · 6.5 km
DESCRIPTION:Strava: 8.3 km at 5:14/km\, avg HR 141\n\n• 2 km easy\n• 3 
 × 1 km at 4:15/km\, 1 min jog between\n• 1 km easy\n\nWhy: Reminds your
  legs what race pace feels like.\n\nFuel: None needed. Eat a normal carb-b
 ased meal afterwards.\n\nHeart rate guide (estimated from your recent runs
 \, may be off):\n• 5:20–5:45/km: easy\, HR 125–150. Over 150 means s
 low down\n• 4:13–4:17/km: HR about 158–170\n\nRUN GUIDE\n\nHow it sh
 ould feel: Race pace should feel easy and automatic. The legs may feel fla
 t in the taper. That's normal.\n\nHow to run it:\n• 2 km easy\n• 3 × 
 1 km at 4:13–4:17/km\, 1 min jog between\n• 1 km easy\n\nElevation: Fl
 at. Under 20 m of climbing\, like the Good George course (+5 m) or your us
 ual morning loop.\n\nBack off if:\n• Don't add reps\, however good you f
 eel\n\nAfterwards: Normal meals. Carb loading starts tomorrow.\n\nhttps://
 joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
URL:https://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#plan
