 · about 160 g of carbs · 5 min\n\n• 1 white bagel with 2 tbsp honey (a
 bout 85 g)\n• 1 slice white toast with jam (about 30 g)\n• 1 banana (a
 bout 25 g)\n• 250 ml juice (about 25 g)\n• About 500 ml water or elect
 rolyte drink\n\n1. Eat it 3 hours before the start\, then sip until 30 min
  before.\n2. Same breakfast as the 33 km and the half. Nothing new on race
  day.\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#fuel
