 teriyaki sauce (about 15 g carbs)\n• 1 small carrot\, grated\n• 250 ml
  apple or orange juice with it (about 25 g carbs)\n\n1. Cook the rice.\n2.
  Brown the chicken\, add the teriyaki and a splash of water\, and cook unt
 il sticky.\n3. Pile on the rice with the carrot. White rice\, not brown\, 
 the night before a big run.\n\nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan
 /#fuel
