SUMMARY:🍽 Early race-eve dinner
DESCRIPTION:Done by 6pm\, so it's settled by bedtime.\n\nTeriyaki chicken r
 ice bowl · about 150 g of carbs · 25 min\n\n• 1 cup (about 185 g) dry 
 white rice\, about 2.5 cups cooked (about 110 g carbs)\n• 150 g skinless
  chicken breast or thigh\, diced\n• 3 tbsp teriyaki sauce (about 15 g ca
 rbs)\n• 1 small carrot\, grated\n• 250 ml apple or orange juice with i
 t (about 25 g carbs)\n\n1. Cook the rice.\n2. Brown the chicken\, add the 
 teriyaki and a splash of water\, and cook until sticky.\n3. Pile on the ri
 ce with the carrot. White rice\, not brown\, the night before a big run.\n
 \nhttps://joshuamorley.github.io/running-plan/#fuel
